<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu 4-mth profit rises 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu 4-mth profit rises 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     502 vs 305</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.94 vs 1.54</p>
<p> Net sales					  6,177 vs 5,751</p>
<p> Operating profit				   606 vs 452</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 10 analysts' forecasts for Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy's January-April profit before extraordinaries and tax had been 235 million markka in a 143-303 million markka range.</p>
</text>
